/**
 * Lets the comment's author flip `isAnonymous` after the fact, so an
attributed comment can be re-anonymized or an anonymous one revealed.
Only the original commenter may call this. The matching `comment`
notification on the parent post owner is rewritten in the same
transaction so its `actorId` (and message text) stay consistent with
the new anonymity state — preventing post owners from de-anonymizing
a comment via stale notification metadata.

 * @summary Toggle the anonymity of one of your own comments
 */
